 black high heels that elongate their silhouettes even more. The women stand in synchronized poses, their bodies slightly angled, arms relaxed at their sides, exuding a sense of poise and assurance. Their hair is styled uniformly, cascading down their backs in smooth, glossy waves, which enhances the visual harmony of the group.\n\nThe background features a pale yellow checkered wall, its geometric pattern providing a subtle yet dynamic backdrop that contrasts with the organic flow of their outfits. The soft, muted color of the wall complements the darker blue of their skirts, tying the composition together. The ground beneath them is a simple, smooth surface, ensuring that the focus remains entirely on the women and their striking ensemble.\n\nThe overall composition feels modern and cohesive, blending elements of urban chic with an air of refined elegance. The coordinated outfits and confident stances of the women evoke a sense of unity, empowerment, and effortless charm, making the scene both visually appealing and memorable.\n\n以上这段是我需要的优质提示词模板，我需要给你一个简单提示词，你帮我补充扩写细节，生成类似于上面这种高质量的提示词，其他细节之类的你可以自己想象来补充和扩展。一定要保证细节多一些，提示词尽量给的丰富一些。我需要最终直接生成提示词，不带任何解释和说明性文字，并且输出为英文提示词", "", 0.6, 154, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 89, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 92, "label": "seed", "type": "INT"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [10, 43, 56], "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "color": "#008181", "widgets_values": ["ae.sft"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [380, 58], "pos": [-2625.0576171875, 559.3663940429688], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id